                            "last_played": 1791597114
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have this weird habit of playing extremely difficult games whenever I’m feeling down.\nI don’t know why I do this. Maybe I enjoy suffering. Maybe I think it builds character. Maybe I just hate myself.\nAnd every single time I play one of these games, I somehow feel that life's not that bad or unfair(unlike this game).\n\n**10/10. 100% recommended.** give it a try. ",
